### Read all users 
GET http://localhost:3001/users

### Create a new user
POST http://localhost:3001/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "Charlie",
    "email": "charlie@example.com",
    "password": "password123"
}

### Update a user

PUT http://localhost:3001/users/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "Mali",
    "email": "maliwan@example.com",
    "password": "pass123"
}

### Delete a user
DELETE http://localhost:3001/users/2

### Trigger centralized error handling middleware
PUT http://localhost:3001/users/1
